- This rule is not constellation Gate and owns no routing or workflow.
- Guard decisions are network-free and verify only expiring hydration and phase-lock receipts.
- When enforcement is enabled, mutating actions require fresh hydration evidence.
- Governed modifications additionally require a current conflict-free phase-lock receipt.
